<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Dirk</h1>
<p>Average Length: Approx. up to 20 inches
Type of Weapon: Distanced Hand-to-hand.
Commonly used by: thieves
</p><p>The dirk was characteristically, almost exclusively, a Scottish dagger weapon. It had a long thin blade, usually sharpened only on one edge, a conical hilt adorned with studs, and often an engraved blade. Dirks were favored by thieves, as they were easily concealed.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla there is no dirk skill of its own: such a weapon is fought with the skill of the kind of weapon it is. Look at it to see which (see <a cmd='#'>Help Weapons</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
